msgid "Qué hace la revisión"
msgstr "What the review does"

#: app/templates/dashboard/index.html:172
msgid "Toca hoy"
msgstr "Due today"

#: app/templates/dashboard/index.html:173
msgid "Cada dos semanas se mira si el peso se está moviendo como debería. Si no, se tocan calorías o pasos, poco a poco."
msgstr "Every two weeks we look at whether the weight is moving as it should. If it is not, calories or steps change, little by little."

#: app/templates/dashboard/index.html:174
msgid "Revisar ahora"
msgstr "Review now"

#: app/templates/dashboard/index.html:174
msgid "Ver la revisión"
msgstr "See the review"

#: app/templates/dashboard/index.html:176
msgid "Sin plan que revisar."
msgstr "No plan to review."

#: app/templates/dashboard/index.html:184
msgid "Cuenta semanas, no días. Una semana vale si entrenas al menos los días de tu plan menos uno: un imprevisto no te la rompe."
msgstr "It counts weeks, not days. A week counts if you train at least your plan's days minus one: one unexpected day off will not break it."

#: app/templates/dashboard/index.html:185
msgid "La semana va de lunes a domingo, y la que está en curso nunca rompe la racha: tienes hasta el domingo."
msgstr "Weeks run Monday to Sunday, and the current one never breaks the streak: you have until Sunday."

#: app/templates/dashboard/index.html:186
msgid "Descansar también es parte del plan; por eso no hay racha diaria."
msgstr "Rest is part of the plan too; that is why there is no daily streak."

#: app/templates/dashboard/index.html:191
msgid "Al principio sale de tu plan: lo que deberías perder o ganar cada semana con tus calorías."
msgstr "At first it comes from your plan: what you should lose or gain each week on your calories."

#: app/templates/dashboard/index.html:192
msgid "Con tus pesajes usamos la tendencia real, la media de 7 días de las últimas semanas, y la fecha se adapta a tu ritmo."
msgstr "With your weigh-ins we use the real trend, the 7-day average over the last few weeks, and the date adapts to your pace."

#: app/templates/dashboard/index.html:193
msgid "El margen es donde caerá la fecha 8 de cada 10 veces. El peso sube y baja por agua, sal o digestión; cuantos más pesajes, más estrecho."
msgstr "The range is where the date will land 8 times out of 10. Weight goes up and down with water, salt or digestion; the more weigh-ins, the narrower it gets."

#: app/templates/dashboard/index.html:194
msgid "Pésate por la mañana, después de ir al baño y antes de comer."
msgstr "Weigh yourself in the morning, after the bathroom and before eating."

#: app/templates/dashboard/index.html:198 app/templates/review/index.html:88
msgid "Cada 14 días compara cómo ha cambiado tu peso (la tendencia, no un día suelto) con lo que esperaba el plan, y tiene en cuenta lo que has apuntado que comes."
msgstr "Every 14 days it compares how your weight has changed (the trend, not a single day) with what the plan expected, taking into account what you have logged eating."

#: app/templates/dashboard/index.html:200 app/templates/review/index.html:90
#, python-format
msgid "Si vas más lento de lo previsto y has cumplido el plan, propone bajar un poco las calorías, como mucho un 5 %%."
msgstr "If you are going slower than expected and have stuck to the plan, it suggests lowering calories a little, by 5 %% at most."

#: app/templates/dashboard/index.html:201 app/templates/review/index.html:91
msgid "Si pierdes peso demasiado rápido, propone subirlas."
msgstr "If you are losing weight too fast, it suggests raising them."

#: app/templates/dashboard/index.html:202 app/templates/review/index.html:92
msgid "Necesita al menos 8 pesajes en 10 días. Si faltan, te lo dice y vuelve a mirar en una semana."
msgstr "It needs at least 8 weigh-ins over 10 days. If some are missing, it tells you and looks again in a week."

#: app/templates/dashboard/index.html:204 app/templates/review/index.html:94
msgid "Nunca cambia nada sola: tú decides si aplicarla."
msgstr "It never changes anything on its own: you decide whether to apply it."

